## SumatraPDF

This project automatically downloads and uses **SumatraPDF**, which is licensed under the **GNU General Public License v3 (GPLv3)**.

- **Project**: https://www.sumatrapdfreader.org/
- **License**: GPL v3
- **Download**: https://www.sumatrapdfreader.org/download-free-pdf-viewer

SumatraPDF is used for silent PDF printing to thermal printers. The bundled version is extracted to `.sumatrapdf/` at runtime and is not included in this repository.

For the full text of the GPL v3 license, see: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html

## Project Source Code

The source code of this project (excluding SumatraPDF) is available under the terms you choose. If you redistribute this project, you must:
1. Comply with SumatraPDF's GPL v3 license
2. Provide appropriate attribution to SumatraPDF
3. Make any modifications available under compatible terms

## Third-Party Python Libraries

This project uses several Python libraries. See `requirements.txt` for the complete list:
- Flask (BSD)
- Pillow (HPND)
- PyMuPDF (AGPL)

Ensure you comply with each library's respective license when using this project.
